#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-color 506> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 506 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 507> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 507 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "PetAction:10:0:1"
msgid "Deals wind damage with a potency of 80.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15-yalm knockback<br>When <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Obey</ui-edge-color></ui-color> is active, will only execute upon command."
msgstr "Наносит урон ветром. <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Сила:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 80<br>Дополнительный эффект: отбрасывает цель на 15 м<br>В режиме <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Слушаться</ui-edge-color></ui-color> используется только по приказу."

#. ja: ダウンバースト
#. de: Fallböe
#. fr: Rafale descendante
#. column 1: Deals wind damage with a potency of 80 to target and all enemies nearby it.<br>When <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Obey</ui-edge-color></ui-color> is active, will only execute upon command.
msgctxt "PetAction:11:0:0"
msgid "Downburst"
msgstr "Нисходящий поток"

#. ja: 対象とその周囲の敵に風属性範囲魔法攻撃。　<ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>威力：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>80<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>「セミオーダー」</ui-edge-color></ui-color>状態では命令を受けるまで実行しない。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Führt eine windbasierte magische Attacke auf das Ziel und die Gegner in seiner Nähe aus.<br>Attacke-Wert: 80<br>Bei der Haltung <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Gib Acht</ui-edge-color></ui-color> wird dieses Kommando nur auf ausdrücklichen Befehl ausgeführt.
#. fr: Effectue une attaque magique de vent sur la cible et les ennemis autour.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Puissance<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 80<br>En mode <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Obéir</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, requiert l'ordre du maître.
#. column 0: Downburst
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 506> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 506 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 507> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 507 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "PetAction:11:0:1"
msgid "Deals wind damage with a potency of 80 to target and all enemies nearby it.<br>When <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Obey</ui-edge-color></ui-color> is active, will only execute upon command."
msgstr "Наносит урон ветром цели и всем врагам поблизости. <br>В режиме <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Слушаться</ui-edge-color></ui-color> используется только по приказу."

#. ja: エメラルドの輝き
#. de: Glanzsmaragd
#. fr: Émeraude scintillante
#. column 1: Increases target's magic damage taken by 10%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s<br>When <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Obey</ui-edge-color></ui-color> is active, will only execute upon command.
msgctxt "PetAction:12:0:0"
msgid "Shining Emerald"
msgstr "Сияющий изумруд"

#. ja: 一定時間、対象が受ける魔法ダメージを10％上昇させる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>15秒<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>「セミオーダー」</ui-edge-color></ui-color>状態では命令を受けるまで実行しない。
#. de: Erhöht den erlittenen Magieschaden des Ziels um 10<nbsp>%.<br>Dauer: 15 Sekunden<br>Bei der Haltung <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Gib Acht</ui-edge-color></ui-color> wird dieses Kommando nur auf ausdrücklichen Befehl ausgeführt.
#. fr: Augmente de 10% les dégâts magiques subis par la cible.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s<br>En mode <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Obéir</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, requiert l'ordre du maître.
