msgid "Decreases damage suffered by pet by 20%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20s<br>When <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Obey</ui-edge-color></ui-color> is active, will only execute upon command."
msgstr "На 20% снижает урон, получаемый питомцем.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 с<br>В режиме <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Слушаться</ui-edge-color></ui-color> используется только по приказу."

#. ja: 体当たり
#. de: Ansturm
#. fr: Charge
#. column 1: Deals earth damage with a potency of 60.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Stun</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 2s<br>When <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Obey</ui-edge-color></ui-color> is active, will only execute upon command.
msgctxt "PetAction:16:0:0"
